{"about_the_game":"In the near future, humanity is teetering on the edge of extinction, subjugated by the fearsome Poison, a plant monster that alters the space-time continuum. Led by the enigmatic Maliki, a handful of temporal survivors have joined forces and are coordinating their efforts from the Domaine, a haven outside of time that is so far safe from the threat.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Sand as you travel through the ages to repair the continuum. Use your Chrono Pack to manipulate time, fight the monsters that have infested past worlds alongside Becky, Fang and Fenimale, a wacky and slightly magical band of characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The demo includes approximately the first 45 minutes of the game, featuring:</h2><br>- The intro<br>- The tutorial<br>- The first part of Chapter 1<br>- The first boss</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496630?t=1743577716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496630/957b13301b4e457866288890e09af38a523e9e5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743577716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496630/45c382850bec3dfb149ae191507976f25d146fa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743577716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496630/45c382850bec3dfb149ae191507976f25d146fa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743577716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In the near future, humanity is teetering on the edge of extinction, subjugated by the fearsome Poison, a plant monster that alters the space-time continuum. Led by the enigmatic Maliki, a handful of temporal survivors have joined forces and are coordinating their efforts from the Domaine, a haven outside of time that is so far safe from the threat.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Sand as you travel through the ages to repair the continuum. Use your Chrono Pack to manipulate time, fight the monsters that have infested past worlds alongside Becky, Fang and Fenimale, a wacky and slightly magical band of characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The demo includes approximately the first 45 minutes of the game, featuring:</h2><br>- The intro<br>- The tutorial<br>- The first part of Chapter 1<br>- The first boss</p>","developers":["Blue Banshee"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2893260","name":"Maliki : Poison Of The Past"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496630/header.jpg?t=1743577716","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Ankama 2025.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095675,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095675/movie480.mp4?t=1740409121","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095675/movie_max.mp4?t=1740409121"},"name":"Maliki : Poison Of The Past Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095675/6b9b90fb0856b7fbc9956163ef881710ea0d6f04/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740409121","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095675/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740409121","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095675/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740409121"}}],"name":"Maliki : Poison Of The Past Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro